OL,2,W+.!/*% *%*%/*%,.! /.!/*%,.!S,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,CTV-related anniversaries for 11 OCT
OL,4,CCHANNELS
OL,5,
OL,6,CG1996FChannel 4 replaces its
OL,7,Flong-running idents with a new concept
OL,8,Fbased around four circles, created by
OL,9,Fits in-house design team. The '4' lost
OL,10,Fits familiar colour scheme and was
OL,11,Fsignificantly reduced in size.
OL,12,
OL,13,FEach circle signified something
OL,14,Fdifferent about the channel's
OL,15,Fprogrammes: one of the circles would
OL,16,Falways contain the channel
OL,17,Fidentification - the '4'; another would
OL,18,Fshow the time at which the programme
OL,19,Fwas to be transmitted; a third circle
OL,20,Fshowed an image which clearly
OL,21,Fidentified the programme; the final
OL,22,Fcircle (not always used) was supposed
OL,23,Sppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBOn This DayCClean FeedFNat TV
FL,122,120,140,200,0,100
